/div><div data-rid="b3a03443-bc8f-420c-9bb2-8bd1a30aac67" class="r-3jezml"><div data-rid="f542f087-5d5b-43c9-a057-19933bc461fa" class="r-1ksmsns"><div data-rid="fd6d10b0-7f4f-4939-857b-1e3c64e2045e" class="r-rgs800 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>faq</p></span></div><div data-rid="e74e59c1-da27-4429-b155-7b18eac210aa" class="r-15k3ijk" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="1d62922c-2384-43f3-a181-7de6e24fcf9a" class="r-1f11484" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="open" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="368ca026-3884-473d-b13d-74856697b4ff" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="replo-:R3br2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-z5ggyx"><div data-rid="97097767-644e-48fd-b5f5-5bf2627c2b0e" class="r-1wcztuu alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span>Will my seafood arrive fresh or frozen?</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="da38a7d3-8946-49b0-9985-99d2523a1783" class="r-rb8x4m r-1jpsufd"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-10u4n1y r-1n1rnz2" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M4 8a.5.5 0 0 1 .5-.5h7a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-7A.5.5 0 0 1 4 8"></path></svg></div></div><div id="replo-:R3br2:" aria-controls="replo-:R3br2:" aria-expanded="true"><div data-rid="5946c194-25b6-4f85-b6c5-546e9b7d601d" class="r-1ybgez5"><div data-rid="2906467c-d0f0-473d-a77d-c25dd3941d9b" class="r-1vi1o8y alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span>Your seafood will be delivered snap frozen on dry ice. Your seafood will be snap-frozen with liquid nitrogen at peak freshness to lock in its flavor, nutrients and texture until you're ready to enjoy it. Unlike seafood at the grocery store that can be sitting out for unknown lengths of time or thawed on arrival - gradually degrading in quality and flavor until it’s purchased.</span></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="6951bc7e-9005-4f5c-8449-376c561c2efd" class="r-1usn6yn" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="33ef4b6c-fe84-4acc-8d9b-46634ee1f564" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R5br2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-6dgjp8"><div data-rid="f652ce27-3ef2-47f6-81a9-2c7c54da0ed0" class="r-64jm6c alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span>Do I have to be home for delivery?</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="2fa323a0-2586-417e-a126-e88fe405f855" class="r-1kp9qq1"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-16ndk72" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R5br2:" aria-controls="replo-:R5br2:" aria-expanded="false"><div data-rid="99e103b0-8d13-424e-87b4-be16ec30e419" class="r-d8bs0q"><div data-rid="48ba3e10-fdd9-4fe4-916c-be2d70ae904e" class="r-cs4dgj alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span>Your fish arrives frozen in an eco-friendly, insulated box with the perfect amount of dry ice to keep your seafood frozen until the end of your scheduled delivery day.</span></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="ea23e57e-9857-4c1d-8a3f-ec604c94bdb6" class="r-1k7qaed" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="acaf47fd-b1a2-4062-82b5-82e032a750b2" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R7br2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1pcgjc8"><div data-rid="07fac1de-84b8-4337-8a4b-3b3cf710549b" class="r-1cszurk alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span>Why a membership?</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="a8dd9779-b3ba-4099-af89-1c689b5a3e82" class="r-101pv7d"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-bh2sqe" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R7br2:" aria-controls="replo-:R7br2:" aria-expanded="false"><div data-rid="43781d79-be4b-412b-8684-8a914f40d78e" data-alchemy-url-hashmark="accordion-overflow" tabindex="-1" id="accordion-overflow" data-alchemy-url-hashmark-ignore="true" class="r-xlnqmw"><div data-rid="7c144f64-ac8a-4557-b469-088151dce4b8" class="r-y36ptc alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Members save 5% or more on their seafood plus get early access to new products. Membership also allows our farmers to plan their harvests more effectively, promoting a focus on quality and ecosystem health. Being a member is placing a vote (with your fork and your $) for a better safood supply chain so that we can live a happier, healthier tomorrow.</p><br></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="cf164192-248f-43b7-954b-a4acd58b5fa7" class="r-hsudho" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="db76926f-1168-43aa-ba33-3577200a843b" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R9br2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-e4nsiy"><div data-rid="381c4aaf-c690-45c6-bbdc-fa3c346c0885" class="r-50beit alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span>Why choose farmed instead of wild-caught?</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="010d858a-a891-4f09-9109-693f130521fe" class="r-jx8uu3"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-1dkpcow" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R9br2:" aria-controls="replo-:R9br2:" aria-expanded="false"><div data-rid="299a763a-a7b9-47ea-aa34-c391122b39e6" data-alchemy-url-hashmark="accordion-overflow" tabindex="-1" id="accordion-overflow" data-alchemy-url-hashmark-ignore="true" class="r-16k6auj"><div data-rid="b908f346-40e0-4297-bd11-32a1af39a4e9" class="r-zex5fy alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Farming allows for controlled inputs. We believe that clean water and clean feed make for clean fish that is rich in omegas, nutrients, and mercury safe and free from detectable microplastics.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="a9bdcfa7-0391-42ab-b09b-62cf3543db46" class="r-xjoirw" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="24dfe2b0-192f-4bdb-9f79-3a31751b5001" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rbbr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-3rwdi7"><div data-rid="f8b202f5-94ca-4058-9015-b63f67bb0e40" class="r-1tr5ax alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span>Can I skip or cancel?</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="4d09bd88-84e6-4f9b-9748-328d79c8ea3c" class="r-2lo9wj"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-1au2gua" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:Rbbr2:" aria-controls="replo-:Rbbr2:" aria-expanded="false"><div data-rid="12b1f85f-8531-4117-ae74-7fd598b9fa27" class="r-1j6grxg"><div data-rid="f79a449c-dd6c-4adf-a040-03e519b8c187" class="r-geme6c alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span>Yes. You can adjust your delivery schedule, plan type, frequency and even cancel completely through your online account portal. If you'd prefer, chat with us and we'll help customize your Membership to meet your exact preferences and schedule.</span></p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="72865462-93f0-4d10-86bd-d712754b0f32" class="r-lpe1il"><picture data-rid="53ea6be7-5367-404b-b9e5-150cc1343bca" class="r-hlse3g"><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0222/9882/0682/files/image_1.png?v=1706632867&amp;width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0222/9882/0682/files/image_1.png?v=1706632867&amp;width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0222/9882/0682/files/image_1.png?v=1706632867&amp;width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0222/9882/0682/files/image_1.png?v=1706632867" class="r-tp2u6w" loading="eager"/></picture><div data-rid="4ce7ff60-bc4c-4a35-9db1-e7ebba1e92e5" class="r-1w8deui alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow noreferrer" href="https://seatopia.fish/policies/privacy-policy"><u>Privacy Policy</u></a> | <a target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow noreferrer" href="https://seatopia.fish/pages/terms-conditions"><u>Terms & Conditions</u></a></p></span></div><div data-rid="58acfd5c-e461-47be-abc9-2f8d9d5803f6" class="r-1ldohaa"><picture data-rid="cb4d79cb-9cc9-4a85-b76a-5f8b2974408e" tabindex="0" role="link" class="r-jbvxlb"><img src="data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg width=&#x27;30&#x27; height=&#x27;31&#x27; viewBox=&#x27;0 0 30 31&#x27; fill=&#x27;none&#x27; xmlns=&#x27;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#x27;%3e %3cpath d=&#x27;M18.1758 8.98633H20V5.64766C19.6875 5.60254 18.6016 5.5 17.3398 5.5C14.707 5.5 12.9062 7.23906 12.9062 10.4342V13.375H10V17.1074H12.9062V26.5H16.4688V17.1074H19.2578L19.6992 13.375H16.4688V10.8033C16.4648 9.72461 16.7422 8.98633 18.1758 8.98633Z&#x27; fill=&#x27;%231A3059&#x27;/%3e %3c/svg%3e" class="r-moso77" loading="eager"/></picture><picture data-rid="67f18f82-a8a0-47f5-9319-b3f4d9794f52" tabinde